{{also|马上}}
==Chinese==
{{zh-forms|s=马上}}

===Etymology===
From {{zh-l|[[馬]][[背]][[上]]|tr=mǎ bèi shàng}}, "on horseback", by extension, "at once; immediately", on account of the horse being the fastest mode of transportation in ancient times.<ref>{{cite-book|author=文若愚|title=语言常识全知道|publisher=中国华侨出版社|year=2014}}</ref>

