===Adverb===
{{head|zh|adverb}}

# [[at once]]; [[immediately]]; without delay; in a minute; [[soon]]
#: {{zh-x|我 馬上 就 回來。|I'll be back '''in a minute'''.}}
#: {{zh-x|馬上 要 過年 了，回去 又 要 拼酒 了。|Chinese New Year is coming '''soon''', and I have to have drinking contests again when I go back.}}
# {{lb|zh|literally|and|literary}} on [[horseback]]
#* {{zh-x|馬上 相{xiāng}逢 無 紙筆，憑 君 傳語 報 平安。|I meet with you '''on horseback'''</br>With no paper and brush to write.</br>Please bring a word to my folks:</br>I'm quite well and all right.|CL-L|ref={{circa|749}}, {{w|Cen Shen}}, ''Coming Across a Messenger Going Towards the Capital''（{{lw|zh|s:逢入京使|逢入京使|pref=《|suf=》|collapsed=y}}）, translated by Tang Yihe}}
#* {{zh-x|馬上 幾多 時，夢中 無限 事。|For these few steps that '''my horse had carried me'''</br>Had taken in my dream countless aeons of time!|CL-L|ref={{circa|822}}, {{w|Bai Juyi}}（{{lw|zh|白居易}}）,{{lw|zh|s:自秦望赴五松驛，馬上偶睡，睡覺成吟|自秦望赴五松驛，馬上偶睡，睡覺成吟|pref=《|suf=》|collapsed=y}}, translated as ''[[s:More Translations from the Chinese/Sleeping on Horseback|Sleeping on Horseback]]'' by {{w|Arthur Waley}}, 1919.}}

